      "title_type": 1,
      "description": "The Endorphin Speed 5 is built to go fast and feel smooth—whether you're pushing the pace on track night with friends or you're chasing a PR. A newly designed nylon plate and responsive PWRRUN PB cushioning come together for snappy transitions and a fast ride. This is speed you can count on. This Tokyo edition is inspired by red and white plum blossoms and the warm glow of amber haze, blending traditional Japanese artistry with the energy of the city.\n\nSpecifications:\nDesigned For — Performance\nShoe Type — Neutral\nCushioning — Responsive\nWidth — Medium\nOffset — 8mm\nMaterial — Mesh Upper\nArch Type — Average to High\nFoot Type — Neutral\n\nFeatures\nSPEEDROLL — Advanced underfoot geometry, propelling you forward effortlessly.\nPWRRUN PB — Saucony’s premiere cushioning material. Made with pebbled PEBA polymers, creating a lightweight midsole with exceptional energy returns.\nSUSTAINABILITY — This style is vegan and contains recycled materials.",
